menu "Matrix Clock"

    config MC_FLASH_MB
        int "Flash size of the board, MB"
        default 4
        help
            Gates the Animation Splash animations that only fit bigger boards
            (see animations.h) and names the build variant.

    config MC_BUILD_VARIANT
        string "Build variant"
        default "release_4mb"
        help
            Name of the release asset this build is published as
            (tetris-clock_<version>_<variant>_fw.bin), also the build key
            the clock looks for in the release manifest.

endmenu
